<title>UK: Brent cargo trades at Sept +18 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades at Sept +18 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of North Sea Brent crude oil traded on Tuesday at September Brent +18 cents, the equivalent of August -7 cents, 10 cents below the previous deal, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load in the August 18-20 range was bought by a U.S. trader.</p>
<p>Last Friday an Aug 18-20 loader moved at August Brent +3 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
